{%- comment -%}
Email HTML with inline CSS: only div, p, b, i, a, br and span survive, with a style attribute and an href to a link
of the view model. No colour on the body: the grey (#8a8a8a) and the link blue (#3b82c4) read on white and on dark.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture nl %}
{% endcapture -%}
{%- assign muted = "color:#8a8a8a;font-size:13px" -%}
<div style="max-width:600px;font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px">
{{- nl }}<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:19px"><b>🔍 What the digest found on its own this week</b></p>
{{- nl }}<p style="margin:0 0 12px;{{ muted }}">Not in the day's selection · {{ runs }} {% if plural == "one" %}digest{% else %}digests{% endif %}, {{ from.date }} to {{ to.date }}</p>
{%- if items.size == 0 %}{{ nl }}<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Nothing was missed.</p>{% endif -%}
{%- for item in items -%}
  {{ nl }}<p style="margin:0 0 10px">• {{ item.what }}<br><span style="{{ muted }}">
  {%- if item.seen > 1 %}in {{ item.seen }} digests, last on {% endif %}{{ item.last.date }}
  {%- for link in item.links %} · <a href="{{ link.url }}" style="color:#3b82c4">{{ link.label }}</a>{% endfor -%}
  </span></p>
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if more > 0 %}{{ nl }}<p style="margin:0;{{ muted }}">{{ more }} more</p>{% endif -%}
{{ nl }}</div>
